">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\lambda,H,Y\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\lambda,H,Y\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 使用所列依赖；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\}\">\\(\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\}\\)</span> 是序数后继。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CumulativeHierarchySegment}_{58}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{CumulativeHierarchySegment}_{58}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 与序数域上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CumulativeHierarchySegment}_{58}(H,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(H,\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\\operatorname{ran}(H))\\land H(0)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;H(\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\})=\\mathcal P(H(\\beta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\nH(\\lambda)=\\bigcup\\{H(\\beta):\\beta\\in\\lambda\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CumulativeHierarchySegment}_{58}(H,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(H,\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\\operatorname{ran}(H))\\land H(0)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;H(\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\})=\\mathcal P(H(\\beta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\nH(\\lambda)=\\bigcup\\{H(\\beta):\\beta\\in\\lambda\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\n\\exists!H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CumulativeHierarchySegment}_{58}(H,\\alpha)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\n\\exists!H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CumulativeHierarchySegment}_{58}(H,\\alpha)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\n\\left(V_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\iota Y\\in V\\;\\exists H\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{CumulativeHierarchySegment}_{58}(H,\\alpha)\\land Y=H(\\alpha))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\n\\left(V_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\iota Y\\in V\\;\\exists H\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{CumulativeHierarchySegment}_{58}(H,\\alpha)\\land Y=H(\\alpha))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}v\\text{-}alpha\\text{-}zero}\\vdash V_0=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}v\\text{-}alpha\\text{-}zero}\\vdash V_0=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}v\\text{-}alpha\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\nV_{\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}}=\\mathcal P(V_\\alpha)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}v\\text{-}alpha\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\nV_{\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}}=\\mathcal P(V_\\alpha)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}v\\text{-}alpha\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\nV_\\lambda=\\bigcup\\{V_\\beta:\\beta\\in\\lambda\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}v\\text{-}alpha\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\nV_\\lambda=\\bigcup\\{V_\\beta:\\beta\\in\\lambda\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个 V_alpha 通过集合大小的初段递归确定，不需要把整个累积层级当作一个集合函数。</li>\n<li>使用依赖文件实际定义的 LimitOrdinal_S，原来的三个层级递归条件均保留。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-emptyset","status":"resolved","id":"0b8de0824384672e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-emptyset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limitordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-union","status":"resolved","id":"5a295a90caf70085","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-union]]","embed":false},{"targe